    "description": "<p>Xsense nanobots engage in tissue engineering, building you a temporary new sensory organ. Most Xsense doses create non-human organs such as snake heat-sensing pits, the magnetic sense of birds, or stranger things derived from xenocritters. Variations on human organs are also possible: tri-cavity noses, eye stalks, or tympanik hearing membranes. These organs can manifest anywhere on your body after 4 hours, then are slowly reabsorbed afterwards. Most users prefer to keep the particular sense and location a surprise.</p>",
